(\\mathrm{TransitiveClass}_S\\)</span> 是下式给出的兼容名；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 为类类型参数，断言处于类模式的元语言。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{meta}\">\\(\\mathrm{meta}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}class} \\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}} \\mathrm{ZfcTransitiveClass}_S(C) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Class}_S(C)\\land\\forall x,y\\in V\\;\\bigl((x\\in C\\land y\\in x)\\to y\\in C\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}class} \\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}} \\mathrm{ZfcTransitiveClass}_S(C) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Class}_S(C)\\land\\forall x,y\\in V\\;\\bigl((x\\in C\\land y\\in x)\\to y\\in C\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}class\\text{-}alias}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\mathrm{TransitiveClass}_S(C)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcTransitiveClass}_S(C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}class\\text{-}alias}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\mathrm{TransitiveClass}_S(C)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcTransitiveClass}_S(C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is a class-schema definition: every element of an element of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> is again in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]",